{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_4AF36288","title":"Discuss Prison with Andrea","entry":"Dlg_4AF36288::entry","exit":"Dlg_4AF36288::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_CA5889AC","articyId":"72057752951734891","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Did I ever tell you about the sector 14 showdown?","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did I ever tell you about the sector 14 showdown?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42300","byteOffset":30331336,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_2B5C4C44","articyId":"72057752951734905","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Old Ticklin' Tess Barker, keys player. She got where she was from hacking. Same muscles as operating a keyboard.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Old Ticklin' Tess Barker, keys player. She got where she was from hacking. Same muscles as operating a keyboard.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31723","byteOffset":19881200,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_3C1D02D4","articyId":"72057752951734919","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Well one night we were playing in Sector 14. right under the Spire. We were just playing some of the classics, Firewalk Funk, Interrobang the usuals.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well one night we were playing in Sector 14. right under the Spire. We were just playing some of the classics, Firewalk Funk, Interrobang the usuals.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1550.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45084","byteOffset":31388856,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_05490060","articyId":"72057752951734933","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Anyway, turns out Tess had been ticklin' more than just the ivory's for that set and had somehow managed to hack every security drone within a mile of the Spire.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Anyway, turns out Tess had been ticklin' more than just the ivory's for that set and had somehow managed to hack every security drone within a mile of the Spire.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1850.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21830","byteOffset":16147560,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_2920B87D","articyId":"72057752951734954","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"It was a fucking light show. Every drone dancing in time with the drums. I cried, the audience cried, I think I even caught a drone getting choked up. Magical.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was a fucking light show. Every drone dancing in time with the drums. I cried, the audience cried, I think I even caught a drone getting choked up. Magical.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52651","byteOffset":34332296,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_9B77984B","articyId":"72057752951734969","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"That's why life is grey now. How can I replace that life without a band?","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's why life is grey now. How can I replace that life without a band?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32668","byteOffset":20242080,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_A762EF2A","articyId":"72057752951734983","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Impossible. They're never never getting out... oh you mean...","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Impossible. They're never never getting out... oh you mean...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42835","byteOffset":30535304,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_A4403735","articyId":"72057752951734997","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Without a band, I have no way of getting on their radar. I'm a nobody now.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Without a band, I have no way of getting on their radar. I'm a nobody now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41457","byteOffset":30011576,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_B01C1CD5","articyId":"72057752951735011","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Hmmmm it's an interesting idea... it could work... yeah. Maybe I'll think on it.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hmmmm it's an interesting idea... it could work... yeah. Maybe I'll think on it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5700.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17598","byteOffset":14547048,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_D32BA47A","articyId":"72057752951735027","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"It was a sort of directional hover thing.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was a sort of directional hover thing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43526","byteOffset":30795928,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_1D2458AC","articyId":"72057606922887668","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Impossible. They're never never getting out... oh you mean... me join them? I have thought about it.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Impossible. They're never never getting out... oh you mean... me join them? I have thought about it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30167","byteOffset":19292224,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_3B7CEE02","articyId":"72057606922887686","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Andrea Cellini","text":"Me joining them? I have thought about it.","speakerId":"Ntt_A5F46049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me joining them? I have thought about it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.a